0..79 Comment "// A theory\'s operation marked `@[ inert ]`, a field only the manifest step and"
80..108 Comment "// another inert field read."
109..111 Comment "//"
112..190 Comment "// A package\'s name and version say what it is called, not what it is. An edit"
191..253 Comment "// to an inert field must move no other declaration\'s content."
254..256 Comment "//"
257..329 Comment "// A model\'s component for an inert operation is inert, and an `include`"
330..402 Comment "// carries the mark. A model\'s inert component may read another model\'s."
403..405 Comment "//"
406..460 Comment "// - see: #3029 — the mark and the refusal of a read"
461..533 Comment "// - see: `pathological/modules/inert-field.gandr` — the reads refused"
